globs: packages/api-client/**/*,crates/octanest-api/src/rpc.rs,crates/octanest-api/src/bin/**/*,crates/octanest-core/**/*
alwaysApply: false
---

# RPC / api-client

- Rust procedure names and types are authoritative (`octanest-api` / `octanest-core`).
- Regenerate with `make rpc-gen` (or `cargo run -q -p octanest-api --bin rpc-gen`).
- Do not hand-patch generated TypeScript as the lasting fix.
- Before PR: `make rpc-sync-check` must be clean (CI `rpc-sync` job).
- Web imports go through `@octanest/api-client` / `apps/web/src/lib/api-client.ts`.
- Document breaking procedure or error-code changes in the PR; keep stable codes when UI depends on them.
